      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "SDK version 3.7.1 is now blocking avatars containing particle systems or trail renderers configured to destroy the game objects they're attached to, in addition to blocking avatars with particle systems configured to disable the avatar root.\n\nExisting avatars will be updated as needed through server side processing.",
